# Catch-all: any remaining www (and plain http apex) → https apex
# (force_ssl is off so these rules can combine host + path into one hop)
https://www.as-painting.co.uk/*    https://as-painting.co.uk/:splat  301!
http://www.as-painting.co.uk/*     https://as-painting.co.uk/:splat  301!
http://as-painting.co.uk/*         https://as-painting.co.uk/:splat  301!

# Trailing slashes: do not add manual /page → /page/ rules here. Netlify already
# redirects extensionless paths to the folder index (e.g. /work → /work/). Forcing
# them with 301! also matches /work/ and causes ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS.
